[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ、はあ……\nリラさん、やっぱり強いね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hah... hah... you really are something else, Lila!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前も腕を上げたな。\nここまでやるとは思わなかった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You've improved. I didn't expect you to push me this far."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうやら、残っているのは俺たちだけのようだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like we're the only ones left standing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "兄さん、イザナさん、リラさん、レイニャさん……\nみんなすごいよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron, Izana, Lila, Lenja... everyone's incredible!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レイニャも、ここまで残れるなんて……\n夢みたいです……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja made it this far... it feels like a dream..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これで５人……\n誰が勝っても目的は達成できるけど、どうしようか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So there's five of us left... any one of us could claim the prize, but... what do we do?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "良い……実に良いぞ！\u3000素晴らしい戦いぶりだ！\n今年の参加者は粒揃いであるな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magnificent... truly magnificent! What splendid fighting! This year's participants are something special indeed!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベスティラ王",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "King of Bestira"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、陛下！\u3000見ていらっしゃったんですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Your Majesty! You've been watching?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "血湧き肉躍るこの感覚……久しぶりだ。\nどう収めてくれよう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My blood is pumping like it hasn't in years. How shall I settle this excitement?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベスティラ王",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "King of Bestira"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……決めたぞ。この興奮は、\n闘いで鎮めるしかあるまい！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I've decided. The only way to calm this fire is to join the fight!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベスティラ王",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "King of Bestira"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい？\u3000何を言って――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry, what—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はああああ！！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "RAAAAH!!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベスティラ王",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "King of Bestira"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えええええ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "WHAAAAT?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この王自らが相手をしてやろう！\u3000\n余を倒した者こそが、真の勝者だ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I shall take you all on myself! The one who defeats me is the true champion!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベスティラ王",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "King of Bestira"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、なんとー！？\u3000王様の飛び入り参加だー！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my—?! The king himself is joining the fray!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "司会",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Announcer"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わあああああ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "YEAAAAAH!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "観客たち",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "観客たち"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くはぁーっ！\u3000なんでもあり、つまり、\nこーいうのもありってことっすか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa—! No restrictions means THIS kind of thing is on the table too?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "観客の皆さん、喜んでるみたいです……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The crowd seems... very pleased with this..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんて国だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What a country!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……王自ら飛び入りとはな。\nだが、分かりやすくていい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...The king jumping in himself. Bold. But at least the goal is clear."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ティムと戦わずに済むなら望むところだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If it means I don't have to fight Tim, I'm more than happy to oblige."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし、元気いっぱい！\u3000絶対に勝つよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, I'm fired up! We're winning this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい、みんなで力を合わせて勝ちましょう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's take him down together—everyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レイニャも、最後まで諦めません！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja won't give up until the very end!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "かかってこい！\n王の力、見せてやろうぞ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come, then! I'll show you the full strength of your king!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベスティラ王",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "King of Bestira"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]